    "summary": "Sign in, find your way around, and where to get help.",
    "audience": "public",
    "order": 1,
    "markdown": "Welcome. This page shows you around. Replace it with your own introduction when you make the app yours.\n\n## Signing in\n\nGo to **Sign in** and enter your email address. We email you a short code: type it in and you are signed in. There is no password to remember.\n\n## Where things are\n\n- **Your account** (`/account`) is for everyone with a login: your details and your notifications.\n- **Admin** (`/admin`) is for the team. You only see it if you have been given a role.\n- **Docs** (`/docs`) is where you are now.\n\n## Notifications\n\nWe only message you about things that matter. Open **Account → Notifications** to choose email, text or push for each kind of message. Texts are only sent if you have said yes, and you can reply **STOP** to any text to turn them off.\n\n## Need help?\n\nRead the [handbook](/docs/handbook/how-this-app-works), or contact the team that gave you this app.",
